paper/figures/v2_table1_draft.tex:31:\caption{\textbf{Main results: per-domain AUROC across three VLM backbones on manifests_v2 test} ($n{=}1{,}418$ items across 12 domains). For each backbone we report the descriptor-free Direct VLM baseline and our \emph{agent+Direct ensemble} ($s = 0.5\!\cdot\!s_{\mathrm{Direct}} + 0.5\!\cdot\!s_{\mathrm{agent}}$), where the agent is \textbf{v10} = v9 refutation agent + parallel independent Direct call; both scores computed in a single \texttt{agent\_v10.py} run per item. Direct uses \texttt{DESCRIPTOR\_MODE=generic} (no domain hint), matching v9's descriptor-free task preamble for apples-to-apples comparison. \textbf{Macro} row at the bottom; $\Delta$ is ensemble macro minus Direct macro. 95\% stratified paired bootstrap CIs (1000 resamples): GPT-5.4 $[+2.58, +5.50]$ $P(\Delta{>}0){=}1.000$; SeedVL $[+4.32, +7.66]$ $P(\Delta{>}0){=}1.000$; Qwen3.5 $[-0.08, +3.51]$ $P(\Delta{>}0){=}0.971$ (positive in mean, CI touches zero).}
